@baseUrl = http://localhost:9001

# Audio ingestion (CON-282). All requests require authentication — run "Login"
# from sessions/sessions.http first. Needs audio-service running (default
# `docker compose up`), object storage (STORAGE_*) and GEMINI_API_KEY
# (transcription + chunk embedding).
#
# Audio never goes through /upload. It's three steps:
#   1. POST /audio/presign   → pending AUDIO asset + presigned PUT URL (30 min)
#   2. PUT <upload_url>      → the client sends the bytes straight to storage
#                              (Content-Type must match the presigned one)
#   3. POST /audio/finalize  → size check (≤ 5 GiB) + tier quota, enqueues the run
# Then poll GET /{id}/audio until the extraction is complete/partial/failed.
#
# Accepted: mp3, wav, m4a, aac, ogg/oga, opus, flac, webm, aif/aiff.
# Quotas (CON-312): presign checks content_bank_assets, finalize checks
# media_storage_bytes — both 402 entitlement_exceeded.
#
# Fixture: sample.m4a (~15 s of synthesized speech).

### 1. Presign  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/audio/presign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "product-update.m4a"
}

> {%
client.global.set("audioAssetId", response.body.asset.id);
client.global.set("audioUploadUrl", response.body.upload_url);
%}

### 2. PUT the bytes to storage (no auth — the URL is signed)
PUT {{audioUploadUrl}}
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./sample.m4a

### 3. Finalize — starts transcription  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/audio/finalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asset_id": "{{audioAssetId}}"
}

### Extraction status + per-segment progress (poll)  [protected]
# extraction.status: pending → normalizing → transcribing → complete | partial | failed.
# A failed/partial run carries failure_code + failure_reason (CON-312).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/audio
Accept: application/json

### Raw transcript (every utterance, incl. non-speech spans)  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/audio/transcript
Accept: application/json

### Searchable chunks with time anchors (CON-312)  [protected]
# Each chunk: source_label "0:00–0:12", source_anchor {kind:"time", start_ms, end_ms}.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/chunks
Accept: application/json

### Asset — content holds the transcript once ready (CON-312)  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}
Accept: application/json

### Rename — title/tags-only save, no content needed (CON-312)  [protected]
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Product update — week 39"
}

### Content edit (expects 409 code=content_locked)  [protected]
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Product update — week 39",
  "content": "hand-edited transcript"
}

### Retry failed segments of a partial run (409 when none failed)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/audio/retry

### Re-transcribe from scratch, optionally pinning a model  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/audio/reextract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash"
}

### Manual first run — only when finalize didn't enqueue (409 if a run exists)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}/audio/extract

### Presign an unsupported type (expects 400)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/audio/presign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "notes.pdf"
}

### Finalize before the PUT (expects 400 "upload not found")  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/audio/presign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "never-uploaded.mp3"
}

> {% client.global.set("emptyAudioAssetId", response.body.asset.id) %}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/audio/finalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asset_id": "{{emptyAudioAssetId}}"
}

### Delete the audio asset  [protected]
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/content-bank/assets/{{audioAssetId}}
